{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "id": "censor-destroys-weaker-fighter",
      "cardId": "op83bq67vaf368q_en",
      "title": "Censor : exiler une Manifestation de la main pour détruire",
      "phase": "confrontation_reaction",
      "priority": "me",
      "players": {
        "me": {"hand": ["$card", {"card": "vanilla:choleric:4", "as": "revealed"}, "vanilla:phlegmatic:2"], "deck": 6, "graveyard": 1},
        "opp": {"hand": 2, "deck": 6, "graveyard": 1}
      },
      "battlefield": [
        {"id": "my-fighter", "owner": "me", "card": "vanilla:capricious:3", "zone": "confrontation", "first": true},
        {"id": "opp-fighter", "owner": "opp", "card": {"card": "vanilla:melancholic:2", "as": "victim"}, "zone": "confrontation", "first": true}
      ],
      "checks": [
        "Censor brille comme jouable (coût 0, il faut une Manifestation en main).",
        "Au lancement, l'UI demande quelle Manifestation de ta main révéler et exiler.",
        "La cible proposée est une Manifestation en Zone de Confrontation.",
        "À la résolution, la Manifestation adverse (puissance de base 2) est détruite et part dans ses Limbes."
      ],
      "script": [
        {"label": "Jouer Censor en exilant la Manifestation 4, cible le combattant adverse", "send": {
          "type": "declare_rules_action", "label": "Censor", "kind": "play_card",
          "source": {"cardId": "$card", "zone": "hand"},
          "abilityId": "censor-exiles-hand-manifestation-to-destroy", "costCardId": "%revealed",
          "targets": [{"kind": "card", "itemId": "@opp-fighter", "cardId": "%victim"}]
        }},
        {"label": "La Manifestation révélée est exilée en coût", "expect": {"zone": "me.exile", "contains": "%revealed"}},
        {"label": "Censor est sur la Pile", "expect": {"stack": 1}},
        {"label": "Les deux joueurs passent", "resolve": true},
        {"label": "Le combattant adverse a quitté le terrain", "expect": {"onField": "@opp-fighter", "is": false}},
        {"label": "Il est dans les Limbes adverses", "expect": {"zone": "opp.graveyard", "contains": "%victim"}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "shattering-the-self-opponent",
      "cardId": "k7dq8ye448xwj54_en",
      "title": "Shattering the Self : l'adversaire défausse 3, sa Manifestation perd 1 par Manifestation",
      "phase": "confrontation_reaction",
      "priority": "me",
      "players": {
        "me": {"hand": ["$card", {"card": "vanilla:melancholic:2", "as": "pay"}, "vanilla:phlegmatic:2"], "deck": 6, "graveyard": 1},
        "opp": {"hand": 2, "deck": 6, "graveyard": 0}
      },
      "battlefield": [
        {"id": "my-fighter", "owner": "me", "card": "vanilla:capricious:3", "zone": "confrontation", "first": true},
        {"id": "opp-fighter", "owner": "opp", "card": {"card": "vanilla:choleric:8", "as": "big"}, "zone": "confrontation", "first": true}
      ],
      "checks": [
        "Shattering the Self demande deux cibles : un joueur, puis une Manifestation adverse.",
        "Le paiement {P}{P} se fait en tribut avec une Mélancolique de puissance 2.",
        "À la résolution, 3 cartes du deck adverse vont dans ses Limbes (animation de défausse).",
        "Migmomirf (puissance 8) passe à 5 : vérifie l'affichage de la puissance modifiée."
      ],
      "script": [
        {"label": "Jouer Shattering the Self : cible l'adversaire et Migmomirf", "send": {
          "type": "declare_rules_action", "label": "Shattering the Self", "kind": "play_card",
          "source": {"cardId": "$card", "zone": "hand"}, "abilityId": "shattering-the-self",
          "paymentCardIds": ["%pay"],
          "targets": [{"kind": "player", "playerId": "&opp"}, {"kind": "card", "itemId": "@opp-fighter", "cardId": "%big"}]
        }},
        {"label": "Les deux joueurs passent", "resolve": true},
        {"label": "3 cartes défaussées du deck adverse", "expect": {"zone": "opp.graveyard", "count": 3}},
        {"label": "Migmomirf perd 3 de puissance", "expect": {"power": "@opp-fighter", "eq": 5}}
      ]
    },
